     One generated icon-only segment for a tool (programmer, BMI, income tax, mortgage, date,
     relatives). It is inflated directly into the pill in tool_bar.xml, after the declared
     123 / fx / (two-way arrow) segments, so it shares their track, radius and selected-state
     treatment. The icon comes from ToolMode.getIconRes() and the content description from
     ToolMode.getNameRes().
-->
<TextView xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    style="@style/ModeSegment.Icon"
    android:clickable="true"
    android:focusable="true"
    android:importantForAccessibility="yes" />
